---
title: CommandMessage Refactoring - Proposed Architecture
---
classDiagram
    %% =================================================================
    %% COMMANDMESSAGE MODULAR ARCHITECTURE
    %% From monolithic (492 lines) to modular (340 lines)
    %% =================================================================
    
    %% === PARSER ===
    class MessageParser {
        <<Parsing & Accumulation>>
        
        -message vector~uint8_t~
        -listening bool
        -ready bool
        -max_size uint8_t
        -module_function uint8_t$
        -module_id uint8_t$
        -command_id uint8_t$
        
        +checkByte(uint8_t) void
        +isReady() bool
        +isListening() bool
        +reset() void
        +getMessage() vector~uint8_t~
        +getData() vector~uint8_t~
        +getDataAsUint8() uint8_t
        +getDataAsUint16() uint16_t
        +getDataAsUint32() uint32_t
        +getDataAsFloat() float
        +freqDecode() int
        +getCommand() uint8_t
        +getModuleId() uint8_t
        +getModuleFunction() uint8_t
    }
    
    %% === COMPOSER ===
    class MessageComposer {
        <<Frame Construction>>
        
        -module_function uint8_t
        -module_id uint8_t
        -command_id uint8_t
        -message vector~uint8_t~
        -is_composed bool
        
        +setModuleInfo(function, id) void
        +setCommand(cmd) void
        +compose(data*) bool
        +getComposedMessage() vector~uint8_t~
        +hasBeenComposed() bool
        +reset() void
    }
    
    %% === VALIDATOR ===
    class MessageValidator {
        <<Validation & Routing>>
        
        -module_function uint8_t
        -module_id uint8_t
        -command_id uint8_t$
        -enable_crc_check bool
        -last_status STATUS$
        
        +validate(buffer*, length) STATUS
        +getCommand() uint8_t
        +extractData(frame*, length) vector~uint8_t~
        +enableCRCCheck(bool) void
        -checkFrameValidity(frame*, length) STATUS
        -checkModule(frame*, length) STATUS
        -checkCRCValidity(frame*, length) STATUS
    }
    
    %% === CRC UTIL ===
    class CRCUtil {
        <<Checksum Calculation>>
        
        -POLYNOMIAL uint16_t$
        
        +calculate(buffer*, len)$ uint16_t
        +verify(expected, buffer*, len)$ bool
        +extractCRC(frame*, len, crc_out&)$ void
    }
    
    %% === UART HANDLER ===
    class UartHandler {
        <<Communication>>
        
        -uart_port* UART_HandleTypeDef
        
        +send(buffer*, size) bool
        +receive(buffer*, size) uint8_t
    }
    
    %% === STATUS ENUM ===
    class STATUS {
        <<enumeration>>
        MESSAGE_OK
        WAITING
        START_READING
        CONFIG_FRAME
        RETRANSMIT_FRAME
        VALID_FRAME
        NOT_VALID_FRAME
        CRC_ERROR
    }
    
    %% === MAIN APPLICATION ===
    class main {
        <<Application Logic>>
        
        -parser MessageParser
        -composer MessageComposer
        -validator MessageValidator
        -uartHandler UartHandler
        
        +processUartCommand() void
        +composeAndSend(cmd, data) void
    }
    
    %% === RELATIONSHIPS ===
    main "1" --> "1" MessageParser : uses
    main "1" --> "1" MessageComposer : uses
    main "1" --> "1" MessageValidator : uses
    main "1" --> "1" UartHandler : uses
    
    MessageParser ..> STATUS : reads
    MessageValidator ..> STATUS : returns
    MessageComposer ..> CRCUtil : calls
    MessageValidator ..> CRCUtil : calls
    
    UartHandler --> MessageParser : feeds bytes
    main --> UartHandler : sends composed frames
    
    %% === DETAILED NOTES ===
    note for MessageParser "RESPONSIBILITY: Parsing\n\n• Accumulate bytes into vector\n• Detect frame boundaries (START/END)\n• Maintain state machine (listening)\n• Provide data extraction\n• ~120 lines"
    
    note for MessageComposer "RESPONSIBILITY: Composition\n\n• Build protocol frames\n• Configure metadata\n• Add CRC (if enabled)\n• Return complete frame\n• ~100 lines"
    
    note for MessageValidator "RESPONSIBILITY: Validation\n\n• Check frame structure\n• Verify module routing\n• Validate CRC (optional)\n• Route (CONFIG vs RETRANSMIT)\n• Extract command + data\n• ~80 lines"
    
    note for CRCUtil "RESPONSIBILITY: Checksum\n\n• Calculate CRC-16 (CCITT)\n• Verify checksums\n• Pure static utility\n• No state\n• ~40 lines"
    
    note for main "USAGE PATTERN:\n\n1. Receive bytes:\n   parser.checkByte(byte)\n   if (parser.isReady())\n     validateAndProcess()\n\n2. Send response:\n   composer.setCommand(0x11)\n   composer.setData(data)\n   composer.compose()\n   uartHandler.send(...)\n\n3. Validate frame:\n   STATUS s = validator.validate(buf, len)\n   if (s == CONFIG_FRAME)\n     process_command()\n"
    
    note "BENEFITS:\n\n✅ SOLID Principles\n✅ Single Responsibility\n✅ Easy Testing (unit tests per class)\n✅ Low Coupling\n✅ High Reusability\n✅ 31% less code\n✅ Better Maintenance\n\nKEEP:\n✅ CRC logic (present but disabled)\n✅ Protocol format (backward compatible)\n✅ All functionality\n\nCHANGE:\n❌ Architecture (monolithic → modular)\n❌ State distribution\n❌ Testing approach"
